cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Project Recherche, cite this software release and the original data releases used in your analysis."
type: software
title: "Project Recherche"
authors:
  - family-names: Fadool
    given-names: John
version: 0.2.0
date-released: "2026-11-21"
repository-code: "https://github.com/fadooljohn-ux/Project_Recherche"
url: "https://github.com/fadooljohn-ux/Project_Recherche/releases/tag/v0.2.0"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Pulsar-timing companion searches with source-specific timing and noise
  preparation, automatic conditional calibration, a second-stage joint-noise
  test, treatment of pulsars in binaries (orbit re-expression, Shapiro-delay
  nuisance basis, nonlinear orbit fits, tempo2 model translation), observed
  known-system recovery, detection and population limits, candidate review,
  and cumulative evidence tracking.
keywords:
  - astronomy
  - astrophysics
  - pulsars
  - pulsar timing
  - exoplanets
  - radio astronomy
